{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11224050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11224050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1122405001:1":{"text":"またお前と金で揉めてる奴か……","source_cn":"又是冲着你来的，银喙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33A01CB2EA54E72D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1122405002:1":{"text":"……お前が金を持って逃げようとしてたって言ってるが、本当なのか？","source_cn":"……他们说你准备卷钱跑路，是真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CBD42FAAB7B9211","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1122405003:1":{"text":"お前も俺を疑うのか、フィアスクロー！？","source_cn":"连你也要怀疑我吗？！烈爪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33EED4362A44683C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1122405004:1":{"text":"俺だって疑いたくはないさ！だが、基地ができてからというもの、ああいう奴がもう何人も来てるんだぞ！","source_cn":"不是我想怀疑你！可是自从建立了基地，这样的人来了好几拨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC59165F72E80E1FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1122405005:1":{"text":"それに、フールが出て行ったのも、懸賞金の分け前に納得がいかなかったからだろ！いいから説明してくれよ！","source_cn":"而且你确实抽成了不少钱，老憨也气不过走了！我们需要一个解释！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAACFDF694CC7D17D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1122405006:1":{"text":"……分かったよ。あいつらが来たとき、確かに俺は基地の金を数えてた。","source_cn":"……好吧。我承认，他们来的时候，我是在清点基地里的钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1F3BE6FBD4F5D0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1122405007:1":{"text":"だがそれは、基地のために買った物がもうすぐ届くから、支払う金を用意してたんだ！","source_cn":"但那是因为我订了一批货，马上就要送来了，我得准备好货款！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66EBF448004CC446","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1122405008:1":{"text":"基地で使う銃や火薬、物資は全部俺が調達してるからな。それから、俺があいつらから金を取ったなんて話は根っからのでたらめだ！","source_cn":"基地里的枪支、火药、物资，全部都是我负责订购的。至于那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1357724A506423FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1122405009:1":{"text":"あいつらに金を貸してた商人が、借金の取り立てにチンピラを雇って、俺から無理矢理金を奪って行ったんだよ！","source_cn":"他们在外面赊了那么多账，是那些商人带着打手找上门，硬生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E2CD4731CD1E460","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1122405010:1":{"text":"チンピラから逃げるためにしばらく隠れてたら、今度は俺が金を持って逃げたってぬかし始めやがった。全部あいつらのねつ造だ！","source_cn":"我不过出去避避风头，结果回来就看见他们一副要生吞活剥了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9E9D8E119FFF2A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_m